{
  "info": {
    "name": "chat-bot-ai — Fase 1 Happy Path (web channel)",
    "description": "Corre el flujo completo de Fase 1 (opt-in → D1/D2/D3 → teléfono → encuesta de 19 preguntas) contra el canal web local, terminando en link_sent (\"🎉 ¡Felicidades!...\"). Usa `isPregnant:true` en la Q13 para calificar por la excepción de cupo (scoring/quota.ts) sin depender de que existan filas en quota_targets para tu entorno local. Corre los requests EN ORDEN (Collection Runner) — cada uno depende del estado que dejó el anterior. Postman mantiene la cookie `web_session_id` automáticamente entre requests del mismo dominio — el request 00 la limpia primero (pre-request script) para que CADA corrida cree un lead nuevo en vez de reusar el de la corrida anterior.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Bootstrap (GET, crea el lead + mensaje de opt-in)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat/web", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chat", "web"] }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Postman's cookie jar persists ACROSS runs, not just within one — without this,",
              "// re-running the collection reuses the previous run's web_session_id and hits the",
              "// same (already-completed) lead instead of creating a new one.",
              "pm.cookies.jar().unset(pm.variables.get('baseUrl'), 'web_session_id', (err) => {",
              "  if (err) console.log('cookie clear error', err);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log('leadStatus:', body.leadStatus);",
              "body.messages.forEach(m => console.log(`[${m.direction}/${m.contentType}]`, m.body));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Opt-in: Inscribirme",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"callbackData\": \"optin:accept\" }" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat/web", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chat", "web"] }
      },
      "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.response.json().messages.forEach(m => console.log(`[out]`, m.body));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }]
    },
